      "content": "CHIPPERFIELD           \tTHE STREET TL 0401  \t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                        12/79                                   \tThe Old Forge 30.11.76 GV                                     \t\tII House. C17, altered and added to. Partly of 1½ storeys; partly of 2 storeys.  Timber  framed  on  stuccoed  sill.  The  exterior  is  mostly roughcast. Steep old red tile roofs faces S. 5 bays wide with door, window, door and 2 windows and a hipped dormer window in the roof between bays 3 and 4. Arts and Crafts plank doors with leaded lights beneath moulded hoods with braces;  matching windows  3-light  flush casements. On the left return a ground floor C20 bay window and a casement in the gable where there is exposed timber framing. On the right return a large chimney against the wall and, set back a further 2 bays with half timbering at 1st floor level. Inside, much exposed timber framing including a wall with all the infilling removed that provides an open screen between hall and sitting room. Listing NGR: TL0422401783"
    }
  ],
